## Commands actually run
## Test results and failures
## Dedicated/multiplayer results
## Visual environment and evidence
## Performance results
## Security review
## Provenance changes
## Known issues
## Gate status
## Evidence paths
## Rollback readiness
```

## 19. Required Gate 与版本状态

本版本 Required Gate 为 **G0–G9 全部**，具体判定沿用
[发布门槛](../06-RELEASE-AND-ACCEPTANCE-GATES.md)及
[质量预算](../17-V1PLUS-QUALITY-BUDGETS.md)。至少执行：

```bash
./gradlew clean build
./gradlew test
./gradlew runData
git diff --exit-code
./gradlew runGameTestServer
```

专服、迁移恢复、真实客户端、性能和许可证分别验收；本文件的契约与目录是
规划目标，不表示已有实现或冻结批准。平台仍固定为 Minecraft 1.20.1、
Forge 47.4.10（兼容通道 47.4.23）、Java 17。

